==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þrettán|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|þritehun|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθrɛhtauːn/|lang=is}}

===Cardinal number===
'''þrettán''' 

# '''[[thirteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tólf#Icelandic|tólf]] and before [[fjórtán#Icelandic|fjórtán]].
#: ''Það eru '''þrettán''' [[jólasveinn|jólasveinar]] í [[íslenskur|íslenskum]] [[þjóðsaga|þjóðsögum]].''
#:: There are '''thirteen''' Yule Lads in the Icelandic [[legend]]s.

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') {{l|is|þrettándi}}.

